    <string name="reset_database_body">Tani waxay nadiifinaysaa boosaska ciyaarta, kuwa ugu cadcad, faylka furan, mawduuca, luqadda, iyo dejimaha barbardhigga. Nadiifi wax walba sidoo kale waxay illowday faylalka maktabadda ee lagu daray. Faylasha muusikada iyo liiska heesaha ee ku jira diskka lama tirtiro.</string>
